### Try the catalog API from IntelliJ: click ▶ next to a request. Run "Login as admin" first.
### Uses the dev admin from application-dev.yml.

### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"identifier": "admin@smartretail.local", "password": "Admin@12345"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### ---- Public (no login) ----

### Categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### Products: filter, search, sort (POPULAR, PRICE_ASC, PRICE_DESC, NEWEST, NAME), paging
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?category=colas&sort=PRICE_ASC&page=0&size=20

### Deals only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?deals=true

### Search
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?q=mango

### Product detail with price slabs and images
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/thums-up-750ml-pet

### Banners and public settings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/banners

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/public

### ---- Admin ----

### Create a category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Soda", "sortOrder": 6}

> {% client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.id); %}

### Create a product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Soda Water 750ml",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "brand": "Kinley",
  "unitVolumeMl": 750,
  "unitsPerCase": 12,
  "price": 300,
  "originalPrice": 330,
  "costPrice": 250,
  "stockQuantity": 40
}

> {% client.global.set("productId", response.body.product.id); %}

### Set bulk price slabs (replaces all)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/{{productId}}/slabs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slabs": [
  {"minQty": 10, "maxQty": 24, "pricePerCase": 280},
  {"minQty": 25, "pricePerCase": 265}
]}

### Upload a product image (JPG, PNG or WebP, max 5 MB). Change the file path.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products/{{productId}}/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="photo.jpg"

< ./photo.jpg
--boundary--

### List all products, including inactive
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/products?q=soda
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a banner
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/banners
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Summer stock-up", "subtitle": "Extra 5% on 50+ cases", "ctaText": "Shop now", "link": "/shop?deals=1"}

### All banners (admin view)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/banners
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
